tolome-gdm-theme (0.2.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Login screen: the user card (.login-dialog-user-list-item) is now
    translucent instead of an opaque grey rectangle with a blue outline:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.08) at rest with the rounded corners kept and no
    border, 0.14 on hover, 0.16 with a thin rgba(255,255,255,0.35) outline on
    focus or selection. The rules are appended to the dark and light
    stylesheets with the selectors of GNOME Shell 48 (last rule wins, also over
    the "!important" focus shadow); the high-contrast stylesheet is left
    untouched. Applied in modes image and flat, not in mode off.
  * Tests cover the card in every mode and check the CSS syntax with GTK 4.

 -- Anhky <dev@tolome.net>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0100

